  (text "IMPLEMENTED: USB power, MCU allocation, buttons, wheel driver/ADC2/encoder, SPI isolation and autonomous brake.\nOPEN: exact PAW3950 reference, IMU, RGB; measured current timing, regeneration, USB behavior and mechanical fit.\nPCB: original placement retained; new wheel components staged off-board pending mechanical CAD. No routing."
